#: ../../source/notebooks/9. 6de3b71b75f440029ff33a00d7e8d1b8 Positions.ipynb:9
#: Rebalancing
msgid "Rebalancing Positions"
msgstr "重新平衡仓位"

#: ../../source/notebooks/9. Positions.ipynb:11 Rebalancing
#: dab1650346704c07a506958dd23cc934
msgid ""
"**PyBroker** allows you to simulate portfolio rebalancing by adjusting "
"your asset allocation to match a desired target. This notebook also "
"demonstrates how to rebalance using `portfolio optimization "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portfolio_optimization>`__."
msgstr ""
"**PyBroker** 可让你通过调整资产配置以匹配目标配置来模拟投资组合再平衡。本文档还将演示如何使用 `投资组合优化 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portfolio_optimization>`__ 进行再平衡。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/9. 753085df938e48d6912c475f90e6954e
#: Positions.ipynb:62 Rebalancing
msgid "Equal Position Sizing"
msgstr "等额仓位配置"

#: ../../source/notebooks/9. Positions.ipynb:64 Rebalancing
#: b5854b5c10ae41e483bbd3b58c35a1a0
msgid ""
"Suppose we want to rebalance a long-only portfolio at the beginning of "
"every month to maintain an equal allocation for each stock."
msgstr "假设我们希望在每个月初对一个仅做多的投资组合进行再平衡，以便为每只股票维持相等的配置。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/9. 47171b20aac54c139cf4d30bb4b51a02
#: Positions.ipynb:66 Rebalancing
msgid ""
