"start of a new month:"
msgstr "首先，我们编写一个辅助函数，用于检测当前 K 线是否为新月份的开始："

#: ../../source/notebooks/9. 54c4bad95c7f43f4a650dd3e3459d44b
#: Positions.ipynb:92 Rebalancing
msgid ""
"Next, we write a ``rebalance`` function to set an equal target allocation"
" for each asset at the beginning of every month:"
msgstr "接下来，我们编写一个 ``rebalance`` 函数，在每个月初为每个资产设置相等的目标配置："

#: ../../source/notebooks/9. Positions.ipynb:117 Rebalancing
#: dddc4706b4d4493193c5711f1bc308d6
msgid ""
"With the ``rebalance`` function complete, we can backtest our strategy "
"using a portfolio of five stocks. To process all stocks simultaneously on"
" each bar of data, we use the ```Strategy.set_after_exec`` "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_after_exec>`__"
" method:"
msgstr ""
"在完成 ``rebalance`` 函数后，我们可以使用包含五只股票的投资组合对策略进行回测。为了在每个数据条上同时处理所有股票，我们使用 "
"`Strategy.set_after_exec "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_after_exec>`__"
" 方法："

#: ../../source/notebooks/9. Positions.ipynb:282 Rebalancing
#: c09a389b1568420093b51571c3acc359
msgid ""
"The ``set_after_exec`` function runs after all executions added via "
"``add_execution``. Since we passed ``None`` to ``add_execution``, no "
"execution logic runs prior to ``after_exec``."
msgstr ""
"``set_after_exec`` 函数会在通过 ``add_execution`` 添加的所有执行完成后运行。由于我们向 "
"``add_execution`` 传入了 ``None``，因此在 ``after_exec`` 之前不会运行任何执行逻辑。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/9. Positions.ipynb:629 Rebalancing
#: d01e3719389d499e8e1502df2e5924e8
msgid "Portfolio Optimization"
msgstr "投资组合优化"

#: ../../source/notebooks/9. 0600fab35f044e61906d2104988d5f8d
#: Positions.ipynb:631 Rebalancing
msgid ""
"`Portfolio optimization "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portfolio_optimization>`__ guides "
"rebalancing to meet specific objectives, such as allocating stocks to "
"minimize risk."
msgstr ""
"`投资组合优化 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portfolio_optimization>`__ "
"可指导再平衡以实现特定目标，例如以最小化风险的方式配置股票。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/9. 3192db120fa6439ba6e79eecb07f5f4d
#: Positions.ipynb:633 Rebalancing
msgid ""
"`Riskfolio-Lib <https://riskfolio-lib.readthedocs.io/>`__ is a popular "
"Python library for portfolio optimization. You can install it using ``pip"
" install riskfolio-lib``."
msgstr ""
"`Riskfolio-Lib <https://riskfolio-lib.readthedocs.io/>`__ 是一个用于投资组合优化的流行 "
"Python 库。你可以使用 ``pip install riskfolio-lib`` 进行安装。"

